# F2: the AUDITED smoke with the fused commit and in-place slides (no live banks, no quad). Every fused publication is shadowed by the eager TP4 path and byte-compared on every chip (deltas and banks); a mismatch repairs the bank and fails the arm. NOT a timed arm.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min; first engine build 10-30 min (kernel compile on a cold cache; 68 traces captured at the first packed round); the four tests 10-20 min: 25 / 50 / 90 min (a collective hang runs the 80-min ready loop, then the reset).
# Read: the launched-argv line (the profile's QWEN_FAST_FUSED_COMMIT=1, _INPLACE=1 and the flags each step names); ONE engaged line '[PACKED-FUSED] ... users=4 rows=16 inplace=1 ... kernel=direct traces=68 layout=1x80'; every '[PACKED-FUSED-AUDIT]' line checked=80 mismatches=0, one per fused publication (audits == fused publications); today-path lines ('path=today reason=R') only with R in ramp or parity; no discard, no 'fused commit refused', no '[PINDIAG] fused commit audit mismatch'; coherent text. c2_smoke_check.py applies these rules and fails the run on them. In concurrent4_steady (four prompts of about 3,500 tokens: every user past the 2,048-row window from round one) every fused round has all four users fused; concurrent4 (two ramp users) shows reason=ramp for those. STOP on a refused build, any audit mismatch, an unexpected reason, a discard, a hang, garbage text.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card fused-commit window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it):
# copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/fcommit and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN (the tag numbers are
# the driver's, on the allowlist). Nothing here names a rig, a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image F0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fcommit-1 is a PLACEHOLDER: set it (in every template of the window) to the tag the driver picks.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset smoke
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-fcommit-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-gate-fcommit
C2_SMOKE_TESTS=warmup,coding,concurrent4,concurrent4_steady
